Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,末班车来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,今天又是赶末班车啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.11,0:22:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,靠....靠....靠得好近
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.09,0:22:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一直盯着我看，我身上有什么东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.61,0:22:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你的眼神，明明像在跟我搭话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,醒着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.07,0:23:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,硬起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.54,0:24:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有硬过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.00,0:24:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,怕被抓吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不会被发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.42,0:24:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不行哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.84,0:24:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没骗你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.96,0:24:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,居然在做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,胀得这么大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.64,0:24:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你也一直盯着看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.29,0:24:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟你刚才也一直盯着我看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.24,0:24:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好烫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.43,0:25:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,平时没遇到过我这种人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.39,0:25:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很罕见吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.27,0:27:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,平时没遇到过我这种人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.71,0:27:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.95,0:27:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,平时才不会有人做这种事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.20,0:28:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚才就一直看着你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.24,0:28:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.88,0:28:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,喝酒喝得身子有点冷，想让你帮我暖暖嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.80,0:29:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就让你舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.86,0:31:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你真温柔呢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.47,0:32:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找这个吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.89,0:32:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么盯着看啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.66,0:32:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,想要我怎么做？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.06,0:32:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.01,0:34:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要舔吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.23,0:36:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.19,0:40:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这次能射出来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.69,0:40:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,又要去了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.83,0:40:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.96,0:51:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,被人看到会被骂的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.39,0:51:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.68,0:51:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别被人发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.86,0:51:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你又硬起来了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.95,0:51:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,还早着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.13,0:51:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没碰到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.21,0:51:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.47,0:51:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才明明才射过呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.98,0:53:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想做了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.45,0:54:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.71,0:54:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.95,0:54:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要是又硬了，你还能行吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.88,0:55:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,又硬起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.06,0:57:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,爽死了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.92,0:57:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可是一直紧贴着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.78,0:57:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.70,1:01:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了，害羞了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.10,1:01:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样都无所谓吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.39,1:04:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.32,1:08:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.04,1:08:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,小意思啦
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.84,1:08:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小意思？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.05,1:08:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时都这么晚回家吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.33,1:08:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你是做什么工作的？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.83,1:08:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你平时都在干什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.37,1:08:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是你，做什么工作的？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.40,1:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那个，我在工厂上班
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.58,1:09:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来，还没问你名字呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.56,1:09:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,名字啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.94,1:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,小诺
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.90,1:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,小诺？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.07,1:09:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常遇到这种事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.16,1:09:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,才没有呢
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.35,1:09:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是有点累了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.79,1:09:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉有点反胃了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.15,1:09:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你家离这儿很近对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.54,1:09:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.95,1:09:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那我背你走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.93,1:09:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.65,1:09:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把我带走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.35,1:09:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,行李呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.51,1:09:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我很重的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.96,1:10:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没，一点都不重
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.87,1:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,加油哦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.56,1:10:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.73,1:10:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,背着感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.95,1:10:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.00,1:10:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只是还不错？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.89,1:10:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,顺着这条路一直走吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.69,1:10:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一直走就行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.22,1:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,加油哦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.15,1:10:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,真的完全不重啦…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.68,1:10:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,抓紧一点哦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.68,1:10:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不然要掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.64,1:10:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,危险，酒要洒了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.99,1:10:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,洒就洒了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.74,1:10:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,反正还有很多呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.43,1:10:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你要喝这么多啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.21,1:10:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.60,1:10:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,很危险的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.94,1:10:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟女孩子喝醉了嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.18,1:11:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,和平时差不多啦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.56,1:11:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好好抓紧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.08,1:11:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这衣服好滑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.23,1:11:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你肯定觉得这房子很破吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.06,1:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,以前我是和奶奶一起住的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.88,1:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,奶奶现在住院了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.36,1:12:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不喝点酒吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.66,1:12:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,多可惜啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.72,1:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你很能喝嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.12,1:12:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你也可以喝哦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.97,1:12:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,干杯
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.80,1:12:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我家也没什么好看的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.57,1:13:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好喝吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.47,1:15:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么感觉你从刚才开始就有点不自在？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.33,1:15:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没、没有
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.83,1:15:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.97,1:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细一看身上好脏啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.09,1:15:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.21,1:15:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可能会把你家弄脏哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.14,1:15:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没事，别放在心上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.28,1:16:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,而且还出了汗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.56,1:16:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,能借用一下浴室吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.01,1:16:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,喝吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.90,1:16:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,够了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.78,1:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,再喝要醉了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.28,1:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,会吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.32,1:16:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你看上去好冷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.53,1:16:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,有那么凉吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.56,1:16:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,很凉哦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.46,1:17:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,得帮你好好暖和一下才行呢
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.32,1:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.72,1:17:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,一会就暖和起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.38,1:17:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,吓我一跳
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.29,1:17:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还在紧张吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.83,1:17:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不是…毕竟都带你回家了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.67,1:17:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,但在电车上时明明更紧张吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.15,1:17:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟不知道会被谁看到哦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.99,1:17:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,话是这么说没错…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.58,1:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么漂亮，我当然会紧张啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.20,1:18:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是这么想的？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.78,1:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你这不是很明显在躲着我嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.09,1:18:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.23,1:18:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,再说，事到如今还装什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.81,1:18:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们明明都做过那么多下流的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.92,1:18:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要躲？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.90,1:18:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,难道你不想跟我做吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.04,1:24:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然已经做过很多次了，但我还是忍不住
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.57,1:26:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.48,1:27:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及了！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.72,1:28:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.93,1:31:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,流了好多汗呢
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.85,1:33:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…要喘不上气了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.83,1:36:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.19,1:36:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.44,1:37:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的，不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.42,1:38:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.55,1:42:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.01,1:42:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.65,1:43:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.45,1:44:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,好粗
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.68,1:44:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不行，好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.33,1:44:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,插得太深了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.78,1:56:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,能听到肚子里的声音呢
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.67,2:01:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,对，要去了
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.18,2:01:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:26.67,2:05:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,进来了…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:47.09,2:05:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,…不行
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.53,2:06:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要射出来了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.02,2:13:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,再稍微…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.52,2:21:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.63,2:21:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,会痒吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:21:24.91,2:21:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,2:21:26.01,2:21:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这里弄脏了呢
Dialogue: 0,2:21:28.46,2:21:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系啦
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.36,2:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里开始
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.89,2:22:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,得弄出来才行呢
Dialogue: 0,2:22:19.03,2:22:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,还是清理干净比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.05,2:23:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,2:23:33.55,2:23:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.13,2:23:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都没能让你高潮出来过呢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.21,2:23:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,明明射了这么多呢
Dialogue: 0,2:23:51.22,2:23:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还沾着吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:55.54,2:23:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可爱吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:23:59.03,2:24:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:05.90,2:24:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我才是
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.08,2:24:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,在电车里做那种事…你经常干吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:35.34,2:24:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次哦
Dialogue: 0,2:24:37.58,2:24:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:43.02,2:24:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,话说回来，当时为什么要找上我？
Dialogue: 0,2:24:46.70,2:24:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,2:24:51.12,2:24:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉你身上…有着和我同类的味道呢



